cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its tools, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "dgt-consultas-vinculantes: binding rulings of Spain's Dirección General de Tributos"
abstract: >-
  Every binding ruling (consulta vinculante) published by Spain's Dirección
  General de Tributos since 1997, as Markdown with YAML frontmatter, together
  with the scraper that keeps it up to date, a full-text search index with an
  MCP server, and a checker against the BOE consolidated texts. Origen de los
  datos: Ministerio de Hacienda.
authors:
  - family-names: Borrero
    given-names: Aldo
  - name: gabela
    website: "https://github.com/gabela-io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gabela-io/dgt-consultas-vinculantes"
url: "https://github.com/gabela-io/dgt-consultas-vinculantes"
# The MIT license covers the code only. The rulings are public documents of the
# Dirección General de Tributos, reused under the Ministerio de Hacienda terms.
license-url: "https://github.com/gabela-io/dgt-consultas-vinculantes#license"
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - tax law
  - Spain
  - Dirección General de Tributos
  - consultas vinculantes
  - legal dataset
  - open data
  - MCP
